-- Class spells as live WoW Forever has them (Blizzard hotfixes after client 1.60.1.70685), from the live hotfix cache that
-- wowsims/forever (MIT, https://github.com/wowsims/forever) builds its spell data from. Found by comparing our data against it.
-- Records are Blizzard's live rows, unchanged, made with tools/full_forever/live_hotfix_sql.py.
--   Mage:    Precision 29438 (was Elemental Precision): +6% hit with all spells (aura 55); the vanilla value row on 29438 effect 0
--            (aura 107) no longer matches the effect, so the server skips it. Accelerant 11069 (was Improved Fireball) also
--            shortens Arcane Wrath. Ice Lance 1312002 gets an 8 sec category cooldown (category 19).
--   Warlock: Bane of Agony 980/1014/6217/11711/11712/11713 gets its third effect (dummy, read by Amplify Curse) and the live
--            tooltip; the vanilla damage rows on effect 0 stay.
--   Orc:     Blood Fury 20572 cooldown 3 min -> 2 min.
--   New:     Dismiss Pet 36562 and Ancestral Spirit 1326619 (resurrect, 600 health / 800 mana) exist on the server; live gives
--            no trainer or learn data, so nothing teaches them yet.
--   Lesser Intellect 3166: live duration (all durations follow Forever); its lower live value is in sql/reserve/full-forever.
-- Spell.db2 texts go through hotfix_blob (enUS). Own hotfix_data ids 2001100-2001209. Safe to run again.
